    "detailed_description": "<strong>SOK PRO - sokoban classic puzzle game. The goal of the game is to move all the boxes to their positions. The player can push one box at a time, but do not pull it off. Completely redesigned SOK game, recreated on a new engine and with new functions.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399300/extras/b01f4c29e2cfd0fd9a0e5c2819bfe0fe.avif?t=1745381721\" /></div><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>\u2714\ufe0f Undo of a move in case of error;<br>\u2714\ufe0f Personal statistics &amp; Steam Leaderboards;<br>\u2714\ufe0f Switch between full screen and windowed mode;<br>\u2714\ufe0f Offline mode;<br>\u2714\ufe0f Convenient and quick selection of the required level;<br>\u2714\ufe0f Ability to change the language and other settings;<br>\u2714\ufe0f Screenshots are working correctly;<br>\u2714\ufe0f New background music (can be turned off);<br>\u2714\ufe0f Selectable background color:<br><i> \u25aa Dark theme;<br> \u25aa Classic, light theme;<br> \u25aa Gold, Lime and Diamond backgrounds.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399300/extras/5bb5fbfe8c0cf5870c64ebfcf829ce64.avif?t=1745381721\" /></div><br><strong>And also:</strong><br>\u25a0 100 different levels, from easy to hard;<br>\u25a0 100 beautiful achievements;<br>\u25a0 Cloud saves;<br>\u25a0 Community Hub Walkthrough Guides.",
